msgid "Manage blocks, custom fields, styles, fonts, assets, and preprocessor settings via the Etch unified dev environment."
msgstr "Beheer blokken, eigen velden, stijlen, lettertypen, assets en preprocessor-instellingen via de geïntegreerde ontwikkelomgeving van Etch."

